## Supabase environment template
# Fill these values on your server or CI

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=public-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=service-role-key
SUPABASE_DB_URL=postgresql://user:password@db-host:5432/postgres

# Notes:
# - Use the service role key only on trusted server-side code (never embed in clients).
# - SUPABASE_DB_URL is optional if you use the Supabase REST/GraphQL APIs and the service role key.
